      [A] Set Atmasphere combat computer  [H] Warehouse
      [D] Set Sector combat computer      [P] Display Planets
      [B] Bank                            [T] TransWarp
      [C] Contraband storage              [U] Upgrade Planet
      [K] Kick an Explorer off the planet [V] View sector              
      [E] Exchange power (ExaWatts)       [W] Who's here
      [S] Exchange shields                [Y] Your stats
      [Q] Stay here and log-off           [L] Leave
      
